    "intervention": "# General preparation candidate\n\nApply the existing Skill. Before a consequential action, state the smallest unresolved question that could change the deliverable. Select a discriminating check rather than collecting broad background. Bind observations to their actual object, revision and environment. Keep a short decision record and reuse an existing result only when those conditions still match. Preserve failed and unknown outcomes. Finish the useful artifact, then verify the task contract. This policy supplies no task diagnosis or answer.\n",
